{"id":"keinerlei","lemma":"keinerlei","pos":"adj","rank":2267,"glosses":["no … whatsoever, no … at all"],"ipa":"/ˈkaɪ̯.nɐ.laɪ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/De-keinerlei.ogg/De-keinerlei.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe keinerlei Pläne.","en":"I have no plans whatsoever.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566540","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"project","l":"Plan"}]},{"text":"Du solltest keinerlei Schwierigkeiten haben.","en":"You shouldn't have any problems.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null,{"g":"difficulty, problem","l":"Schwierigkeit"},{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Es besteht keinerlei Hoffnung.","en":"There's no hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68220","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},null,{"g":"hope"}]},{"text":"Ich habe keinerlei Erinnerung mehr daran.","en":"I don't remember anything about it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"memory"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"on it, on that"}]},{"text":"Einige dieser Arbeiter haben keinerlei Erfahrung.","en":"Some of the workers have no experience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/562265","words":[{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"experience"}]}]}